      "content": "but i feel 100% normal now. like my vision is perfect and my hand is fine. i dont really want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if it was just a one time thing. is it possible it was just a migraine or maybe just low blood sugar? can i just wait until tomorrow to see if it happens again?",
